  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-refactor/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.references`. The requirement lets a skill link to files for specialized material (a MAY). It obliges each such link to say when to read the file. The file contains no Markdown links or file links. Its mentions of the habeas-evidence and habeas-requirements skills are plain-text names, not links to files. The \"Disagreeing assessments\" mention is also plain text. Its step 7 does say when to use those skills. The skill therefore has no link that lacks a \"when to read\" statement, and I found no gap. The requirement defines no violation queries for this site.",
